
  <main id="main">

    <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
    <section class="hero ai-hero" aria-labelledby="heroTitle">
      <div class="container hero__inner ai-hero__grid">
        <div class="ai-hero__top">
          <span class="eyebrow">AI process automation &middot; South Africa</span>
          <h1 id="heroTitle">Find the work your employees <em>shouldn&rsquo;t be doing.</em></h1>
        </div>
        <div class="hero__copy">
          <p class="lead">We design and implement AI systems that automate repetitive business processes, connect your existing software and give your teams better access to the information they already have. Then we measure what changed.</p>
          <div class="btn-row hero__cta">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary btn--large" data-review-open>Book a process review</button>
            <a href="#results" class="btn btn--ghost btn--large">See what we measure</a>
          </div>
          <ul class="hero__trust">
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg> Measured before and after</li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg> Fixed-scope implementation</li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"/></svg> Run and improved every month</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="hero__visual ai-hero__visual">
          <figure class="pv reveal" data-pv aria-label="An example of an AI system at work: an incoming enquiry is read, its requirements extracted, the knowledge base checked and a reply prepared for a person to approve. Preparation time drops from about 15 minutes to about 3.">
            <div class="pv__head">
              <span class="pv__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="pv__title" data-pv-title>Enquiry handling</span>
              <span class="pv__tag">Example</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pv__in" data-pv-in>
              <span class="pv__from" data-pv-from>New email · info@</span>
              <p data-pv-msg>Hi, we're buying a house in Edenvale for R2.4m and need transfer done before 30 November. What do you charge, and what do you need from us?</p>
            </div>
            <ol class="pv__steps">
              <li class="pv__step" data-pv-step="0"><span class="pv__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h10M4 18h7"/></svg></span><div><b data-pv-s0>Requirements extracted</b><span class="pv__chips" data-pv-c0></span></div></li>
              <li class="pv__step" data-pv-step="1"><span class="pv__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 4h10l4 4v12H5z"/><path d="M14 4v5h5"/></svg></span><div><b data-pv-s1>Knowledge base checked</b><span class="pv__src" data-pv-c1></span></div></li>
              <li class="pv__step" data-pv-step="2"><span class="pv__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 20l4-1 11-11-3-3L5 16z"/></svg></span><div><b data-pv-s2>Reply prepared for approval</b><span class="pv__draft" data-pv-c2></span></div></li>
            </ol>
            <div class="pv__result">
              <span class="pv__label" data-pv-metric>Preparation time per enquiry</span>
              <div class="pv__nums"><s data-pv-before>~15 min</s><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg><b data-pv-after>~3 min</b></div>
              <div class="pv__bar" aria-hidden="true"><i data-pv-bar></i></div>
            </div>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ WHERE THE HOURS GO (marquee) ============ -->
    <section class="marquee-strip" aria-label="Processes we automate">
      <h2 class="visually-hidden">Processes we automate</h2>
      <div class="marquee" data-marquee>
        <div class="marquee__track">
          <ul class="marquee__row">
            <li>Enquiry handling</li>
            <li>Document search</li>
            <li>Quote preparation</li>
            <li>Invoice capture</li>
            <li>Email triage</li>
            <li>Client onboarding</li>
            <li>Monthly reporting</li>
            <li>Data entry between systems</li>
            <li>Compliance checks</li>
            <li>Scheduling &amp; follow-ups</li>
            <li>Staff questions</li>
            <li>Proposal drafting</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ PROBLEM → SOLUTION → RESULT ============ -->
    <section class="section" id="results" aria-labelledby="resultsTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">What this looks like</span>
          <h2 id="resultsTitle">A process, a system, a number.</h2>
          <p>We don&rsquo;t sell AI. We take one process that eats your team&rsquo;s time, build the system that does the repetitive part, and measure the difference.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="psr-grid">
          <article class="psr reveal">
            <span class="psr__kind">Enquiries</span>
            <div class="psr__row"><span class="psr__k">Problem</span><p>Staff spend around 15 hours a week reading enquiries and writing replies.</p></div>
            <div class="psr__row"><span class="psr__k">Solution</span><p>AI reads each incoming enquiry, extracts the requirements, checks your knowledge base and prepares the response for a person to approve.</p></div>
            <div class="psr__row psr__row--result"><span class="psr__k">Result</span><p><b>Response preparation from ~15 minutes to ~3 minutes.</b></p></div>
          </article>
          <article class="psr reveal">
            <span class="psr__kind">Knowledge</span>
            <div class="psr__row"><span class="psr__k">Problem</span><p>Policies, prices and procedures live in shared drives, PDFs and old emails &mdash; or in the head of the one person everyone interrupts.</p></div>
            <div class="psr__row"><span class="psr__k">Solution</span><p>The documents your staff search for manually become one integrated knowledge base. They ask in plain language and get the answer with its source linked.</p></div>
            <div class="psr__row psr__row--result"><span class="psr__k">Result</span><p><b>Finding an answer from ~10 minutes of searching to under 1 minute.</b></p></div>
          </article>
          <article class="psr reveal">
            <span class="psr__kind">Admin</span>
            <div class="psr__row"><span class="psr__k">Problem</span><p>Invoices, forms and orders arrive as attachments and get retyped into your accounting or job system.</p></div>
            <div class="psr__row"><span class="psr__k">Solution</span><p>AI reads the document, extracts the fields, checks them against your records and posts them to your software &mdash; flagging anything unusual for review.</p></div>
            <div class="psr__row psr__row--result"><span class="psr__k">Result</span><p><b>Capture time from ~6 minutes to ~1 minute per document.</b></p></div>
          </article>
        </div>
        <p class="psr-note reveal">These are examples of the results we target. Every engagement starts by measuring <em>your</em> baseline, and every result we report is measured against it.</p>
        <div class="section__foot btn-row reveal">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="ai-demos">Try seven AI demos</a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="ai-for-business">More processes we improve</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ ROI CALCULATOR ============ -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="roi" aria-labelledby="roiTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head section__head--center reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Run your own numbers</span>
          <h2 id="roiTitle">What is that work costing you?</h2>
          <p>A rough estimate in ten seconds. Discovery replaces it with a measured one.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="roi reveal" data-roi>
          <div class="roi__inputs">
            <label class="roi__field"><span>People doing this work</span><output data-roi-out="people">3</output><input type="range" name="people" min="1" max="50" value="3" /></label>
            <label class="roi__field"><span>Hours each spends on it per week</span><output data-roi-out="hours">5</output><input type="range" name="hours" min="1" max="40" value="5" /></label>
            <label class="roi__field"><span>Their monthly salary (R)</span><output data-roi-out="salary">R25,000</output><input type="range" name="salary" min="8000" max="120000" step="1000" value="25000" /></label>
            <label class="roi__field"><span>Share of that work a system could take over</span><output data-roi-out="share">60%</output><input type="range" name="share" min="20" max="90" step="5" value="60" /></label>
          </div>
          <div class="roi__out" aria-live="polite">
            <div><span>Hours back every month</span><b data-roi="hours">0</b></div>
            <div><span>Value of that time, per month</span><b data-roi="month">R0</b></div>
            <div class="roi__big"><span>Per year</span><b data-roi="year">R0</b></div>
            <p class="tiny muted">Hours × loaded cost (salary × 1.3 ÷ 173 hours). An estimate, not a promise: we measure the real figure in discovery.</p>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary btn--full" data-review-open>Measure it properly</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ THE METHOD ============ -->
    <section class="section" id="process" aria-labelledby="processTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">The Re-Charge Method</span>
          <h2 id="processTitle">Seven phases. Nothing goes to production that hasn&rsquo;t proved itself.</h2>
        </div>
        <ol class="phases reveal">
          <li><span>1</span><b>Discovery</b><p>Map the people, processes, software, data, bottlenecks and decision points. Measure the baseline.</p></li>
          <li><span>2</span><b>Opportunity mapping</b><p>Score every opportunity on time saved, revenue, difficulty, data, risk and adoption.</p></li>
          <li><span>3</span><b>Proof of concept</b><p>Build the smallest useful version, on real work.</p></li>
          <li><span>4</span><b>ROI validation</b><p>Before vs after, on the same measure. Go, adjust, or stop.</p></li>
          <li><span>5</span><b>Production</b><p>Integrate properly with your software, with logging and safe fallbacks.</p></li>
          <li><span>6</span><b>Adoption</b><p>Train the people who use it, and adjust to how they actually work.</p></li>
          <li><span>7</span><b>Optimisation</b><p>Monitor, evaluate and improve. A report every month.</p></li>
        </ol>
        <div class="section__foot btn-row reveal">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="method">How the method works</a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="method#score">Score an opportunity</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ HOW WE CHARGE ============ -->
    <section class="section section--tint" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="pricingTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">How we charge</span>
          <h2 id="pricingTitle">A defined scope to build it. A defined SLA to run it.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="model reveal">
          <div class="model__col">
            <span class="model__k">Implementation</span>
            <h3>Fixed scope, fixed price</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><span>Discovery &amp; opportunity map</span><b>R7,500</b></li>
              <li><span>Proof of concept</span><b><small>from</small> R18,500</b></li>
              <li><span>Production implementation</span><b><small>from</small> R45,000</b></li>
            </ul>
            <p class="small muted">Discovery is credited in full if you go ahead within 60 days.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="model__col model__col--accent">
            <span class="model__k">Operations</span>
            <h3>Monthly, with an SLA</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><span>Operate</span><b>R4,500<small>/mo</small></b></li>
              <li><span>Optimise</span><b>R9,500<small>/mo</small></b></li>
              <li><span>Partner</span><b>R18,500<small>/mo</small></b></li>
            </ul>
            <p class="small muted">Monitoring, model and API costs, maintenance, security updates, evaluation, support, improvements and a monthly ROI report.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="model__col">
            <span class="model__k">Everything else</span>
            <h3>Priced separately, never hidden</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><span>Change requests</span><b>R850<small>/h</small></b></li>
              <li><span>New functionality</span><b>Own project</b></li>
              <li><span>Consulting</span><b>R1,250<small>/h</small></b></li>
              <li><span>Emergency support</span><b>R1,650<small>/h</small></b></li>
            </ul>
            <p class="small muted">So the scope never drifts and nobody is surprised by an invoice.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="section__foot btn-row reveal">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="pricing">Full pricing &amp; SLA</a>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost" data-review-open>Book a process review</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ WHY ============ -->
    <section class="section section--dark" id="why" aria-labelledby="whyTitle">
      <div class="container trust">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Why Re-Charge</span>
          <h2 id="whyTitle">We&rsquo;re not tied to a model. We&rsquo;re tied to your result.</h2>
          <blockquote>Models change every few months. Your processes, your data and the number we&rsquo;re improving don&rsquo;t. <em>That&rsquo;s where we work.</em></blockquote>
          <p class="muted">One developer, start to finish: the person who maps your process is the person who builds the system and answers when it needs attention.</p>
          <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:1.6rem">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn--light" data-review-open>Book a process review</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="trust__points reveal">
          <li><strong>Measured, not promised</strong><span>A baseline before we build. The same measure after. A report every month.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Model-independent</strong><span>We pick the right model for each step and swap it when a better one arrives.</span></li>
          <li><strong>People stay in charge</strong><span>Where a mistake would cost you, the system prepares and a person approves.</span></li>
          <li><strong>You own it</strong><span>Your data, your accounts, your system. Handled under POPIA.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ WEBSITES (secondary) ============ -->
    <section class="section" id="websites" aria-labelledby="websitesTitle">
      <div class="container band">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Also</span>
          <h2 id="websitesTitle">Need a website, not a system?</h2>
          <p class="lead">We still build fast, professional websites for small businesses, from R1,000 &mdash; with a free preview before you decide.</p>
          <div class="btn-row">
            <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="services#websites">Websites</a>
